{
  "slug": "arn-infra",
  "name": "Arn Infra",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Infrastructure and deployment for Claude Code — containerization, IaC generation (OpenTofu/Pulumi/CDK), CI/CD pipelines, environments, secrets, monitoring. 23 skills, 9 agents.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **25 skills** and **10 agents**.\n\n- **Skills** (25): `arn-infra-assess` (This skill should be used when the user says \"assess infrastructure\", \"infra assess\", \"arn infra assess\", \"infrastructure assessment\",…), `arn-infra-change-plan` (This skill should be used when the user says \"plan infra change\", \"arn-infra-change-plan\", \"infra change plan\", \"plan this…), `arn-infra-change-spec` (This skill should be used when the user says \"infra change spec\", \"infrastructure change\", \"specify infrastructure change\", \"change…), `arn-infra-cleanup` (This skill should be used when the user says \"cleanup\", \"infra cleanup\", \"arn infra cleanup\", \"clean up resources\",…), `arn-infra-containerize` (This skill should be used when the user says \"containerize\", \"dockerize\", \"create dockerfile\", \"docker setup\", \"container setup\", \"arn…), `arn-infra-define` (This skill should be used when the user says \"define infrastructure\", \"generate IaC\", \"infra define\", \"arn infra define\",…), `arn-infra-deploy` (This skill should be used when the user says \"deploy\", \"deploy to staging\", \"deploy to production\", \"promote to…), `arn-infra-discover` (This skill should be used when the user says \"discover tools\", \"infra discover\", \"arn infra discover\", \"arn-infra-discover\", \"audit…), and 17 more\n- **Agents** (10): `arn-infra-change-planner` (This agent should be used when a skill needs to generate a phased infrastructure implementation plan from a…), `arn-infra-change-reviewer` (This agent should be used when the arn-infra-review-change skill or arn-infra-execute-change skill needs a structured quality review of…), `arn-infra-cost-analyst` (This agent should be used when infrastructure changes need cost estimation before deployment, when the user wants to…), `arn-infra-doctor` (This agent should be used when the arn-infra-report skill needs diagnostic investigation of an Arness Infra workflow issue), `arn-infra-pipeline-builder` (This agent should be used when CI/CD pipeline configurations need to be generated or extended for infrastructure deployment), `arn-infra-reference-researcher` (This agent should be used when the arn-infra-refresh skill needs to research online for the latest versions of…), `arn-infra-request-analyzer` (This agent should be used when an infrastructure request issue needs analysis to determine what cloud resources, configuration…), `arn-infra-security-auditor` (This agent should be used when generated infrastructure code, container configurations, or cloud resource definitions need security review), and 2 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install arn-infra@claude-community` from `AppsVortex/arness` (`plugins/arn-infra`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
